---
// src/pages/about.astro - SGA Presentation Master Dossier v4.2 (Subject 7 Edition)
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@200..1000&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>About | SGA Nexus Intelligence</title>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen p-4 md:p-12 overflow-x-hidden bg-[#020617] scroll-smooth">

<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -left-[20%] w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-orange-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full animate-mesh-fast"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-16 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] hover:text-white transition-colors">← Return to Dashboard</a>
        <h1 style="font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;" class="text-5xl tracking-tighter text-white font-black uppercase mt-4 leading-none">
            THE <span class="text-orange-500">SGA</span> DOSSIER
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Bilateral Tech-Consultancy & Digital Ecosystem</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-16">
        <section id="section-01">
            <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">01. Organization</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Superior Gaming Agency</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
                <p><b class="text-white">SGA</b> is an international technology-concierge organization. We bridge specialized hardware needs and advanced software management.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="section-02">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">02. Collective Intelligence</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">The Nexus Protocol</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p><b class="text-white">Nexus</b> utilizes synchronous brainstorming methodology to convert team ideas into industrial-grade output.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="section-03" class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-24 h-24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">03. The Consulting Phase</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Next-Gen Advisory</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>Hardware management anchored by the <b class="text-white">SGA Agent</b>, detecting bottlenecks before they impact performance.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-24 space-y-48 pb-32 relative">

            <header id="slide-intro" class="text-center mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
                <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic font-mono">Academic Subject 07</span>
                <h2 class="text-6xl font-black text-white uppercase italic mt-1 leading-none tracking-tighter">THE <span class="text-orange-500">CONTROLLING</span> MODEL</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-500 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-6">Comparative Analysis: Strategic vs. Operative Frameworks</p>
            </header>

            <div id="slide-1" class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center scroll-mt-32">
                <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-slate-900 border border-orange-500/20 p-10 rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl relative aspect-square flex flex-col justify-center text-center overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-orange-500/5 animate-pulse"></div>
                    <h3 class="text-4xl font-black text-white italic uppercase leading-none tracking-tighter">DUAL<br/><span class="text-orange-500">CONTROL</span><br/>PILLARS</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-6">
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic">The Controlling Engine</h4>
                    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 text-sm">
                        <p>Controlling is the <b>Cybernetic Engine</b> of management. It converts raw system data into institutional intelligence through two distinct lenses:</p>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase">
                            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-orange-500">●</span> <b>Operative:</b> Efficiency ("Doing things right")</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-indigo-400">●</span> <b>Strategic:</b> Effectiveness ("Doing the right things")</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex absolute -right-16 flex-col gap-2">
                    <a href="#slide-intro" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↑</a>
                    <a href="#slide-2" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↓</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="slide-2" class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center scroll-mt-32">
                <div class="md:col-span-6 order-2 md:order-1 space-y-6">
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic">Operative: Managing the "Now"</h4>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm italic">Focus: Short-term stability and internal efficiency.</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                                <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black block mb-1">TIME HORIZON</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Under 1 year (Monthly/Daily metrics).</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                                <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black block mb-1">PRIMARY GOAL</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Variance Analysis: $Actual - Target = 0$</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-5 order-1 md:order-2 bg-slate-900 border border-orange-500/40 p-10 rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl aspect-square flex flex-col justify-center text-center">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                        <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold text-xs">TARGET: 70°C</span>
                        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold text-xs animate-pulse">ACTUAL: 95°C</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-1 bg-slate-800 w-full mb-8"><div class="h-full bg-orange-500 w-[95%] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(249,115,22,0.5)]"></div></div>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-white italic uppercase tracking-tighter">OPERATIVE<br/><span class="text-orange-500">EFFICIENCY</span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex absolute -right-16 flex-col gap-2">
                    <a href="#slide-1" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↑</a>
                    <a href="#slide-3" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↓</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="slide-3" class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center scroll-mt-32">
                <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-indigo-500/5 border border-indigo-500/20 p-10 rounded-[3rem] shadow-2xl aspect-square flex flex-col justify-center text-center">
                    <div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-1 mb-8">
                        <div class="w-4 h-8 bg-indigo-500/20"></div>
                        <div class="w-4 h-12 bg-indigo-500/40"></div>
                        <div class="w-4 h-20 bg-indigo-500/60"></div>
                        <div class="w-4 h-28 bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)]"></div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-white italic uppercase tracking-tighter text-indigo-400">STRATEGIC<br/><span class="text-white">LONGEVITY</span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-6">
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic leading-tight">Strategic: Securing the Future</h4>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm italic">Focus: Long-term sustainability and external effectiveness.</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                            <div class="p-4 bg-indigo-500/5 border border-indigo-500/20 rounded-2xl">
                                <span class="text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-black block mb-1">TIME HORIZON</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">3-5 Years (Market trends and lifespan analysis).</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-4 bg-indigo-500/5 border border-indigo-500/20 rounded-2xl">
                                <span class="text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-black block mb-1">FEED-FORWARD CONTROL</span>
                                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Proactive Trend Recognition (Preventing bottlenecks).</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex absolute -right-16 flex-col gap-2">
                    <a href="#slide-2" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">↑</a>
                    <a href="#slide-4" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">↓</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="slide-4" class="relative grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center scroll-mt-32">
                <div class="md:col-span-12">
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mb-8 text-center">The Comparative Matrix</h4>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                        <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-[11px] uppercase border-collapse">
                            <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-500">
                                <th class="py-4 px-2">Dimension</th>
                                <th class="py-4 px-2 text-orange-500">Operative</th>
                                <th class="py-4 px-2 text-indigo-400">Strategic</th>
                            </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-900">
                                <td class="py-4 px-2 font-bold text-white">Orientation</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">Internal (Efficiency)</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">External (Effectiveness)</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-900">
                                <td class="py-4 px-2 font-bold text-white">Information</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">Quantitative / Precision</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">Qualitative / Patterns</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="border-b border-slate-900">
                                <td class="py-4 px-2 font-bold text-white">Control Loop</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">Feedback (Reactive)</td>
                                <td class="py-4 px-2">Feed-Forward (Proactive)</td>
                            </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex absolute -right-16 flex-col gap-2">
                    <a href="#slide-3" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-white transition-colors">↑</a>
                    <a href="#slide-5" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-white transition-colors">↓</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="slide-5" class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-black border border-slate-800 p-16 rounded-[4rem] text-center overflow-hidden scroll-mt-32">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-orange-500/5 animate-mesh-fast"></div>
                <div class="relative space-y-8">
                    <h3 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white uppercase italic tracking-tighter leading-none">THE <span class="text-orange-500">INTEGRATED</span> LOOP</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto italic leading-relaxed">
                        Managers connect <b>Operative Data</b> (Today's performance) with <b>Strategic Vision</b> (Tomorrow's existence) to secure asset value.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex absolute -right-16 flex-col gap-2">
                    <a href="#slide-4" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↑</a>
                    <a href="#slide-intro" class="p-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">↺</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center space-y-10 pb-20">
                <h3 class="text-white text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black uppercase italic tracking-tighter leading-none">
                    WATCH THE <span class="text-orange-500">PRESENT</span><br/>
                    PROTECT THE <span class="text-indigo-400">FUTURE</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.8em]">SGA // Subject 07 Management Review</p>
            </div>

        </section>

        <footer class="pt-12 border-t border-slate-900 flex justify-center text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-[0.5em] mb-12">
            SGA // Bilateral Operations &copy; 2026
        </footer>
    </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    @keyframes move-mesh {
        0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
        50% { transform: translate(10%, 5%) scale(1.05); }
        100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
    }
    .animate-mesh-fast { animation: move-mesh 15s infinite alternate ease-in-out; }
</style>
</body>
</html>